Hi Sam,

We try to stick to our 11-3 shift for yurt and site maintenance for a few r=
easons, some people check out early and it gives you a chance to get starte=
d on cleaning even if it is before 1pm, we also have people that try to che=
ck in early to their sites before 4 pm and this is fine as long as the site=
s or yurts have been cleaned, and we also try to have everything done befor=
e it hits 4pm that way if there are any issues going on at the site we have=
 time to try and prepare or contact incoming arrivals.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB8C55.092FD4C0]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
