From: Robert Samuel White <rsw@rswfire.com>
Sent: Saturday, March 1, 2025 8:26 PM
To: BLISS Logan * OPRD <Logan.BLISS@oprd.oregon.gov>
Subject: Work Schedule


Hi Logan,

I had a quick question about scheduling.

When I asked Patrick if I could work from 12-4, he said he wasn't sure and =
that I should check with you. He also told me, twice, "not to get my hopes =
up." I want to clarify that I wasn't getting my hopes up - I wanted to know=
 if we had the same flexibility here that I had at Tugman. They let us set =
our own hours for cleaning yurts and campsites - the deadline was 4.

Every park operates differently, so I was just trying to get clarity when a=
sking but it sure seems like Patrick took it differently. Can you confirm i=
f we have until 4 to finish our work? Or is there a required structure? Jus=
t want to make sure I'm aligned with what works best for the team.

Thanks,
Sam

